Z||000000||doughboySE||03-29-2000||11:18 PM||||hey guys before i go bother dave derbeshire can anyone tell me what this would be?<BR>in first gear as i let out the clutch and give her gas it hesitates and then goes like snot. sometimes if i am at a light and have it in neutral and slam the gas down it to hear the rumbal it hesitates and backfires. not only this but if im driving along with foot slightly on the gas and slightly take foot off a bit there seems to be the power that you would think the car should have?<BR>also if im in say 3rd and am driving through town and have foot off gas it gets really jerky like leaving a light in 3rd gear but if i touch the gas she seems fine.<BR>keep in mind it has new plugs and wires<BR>thanx for your help again||||reg||1
Z||000001||daved||03-29-2000||11:43 PM||||I'll bet you have some codes that need attention! LOL<BR>Sounds like it may be running weak. I had power problems and changed my Oxygen sensor, (Codes 13 & 44...O2 sensor  & weak mixture)and it runs a lot better.  How many kM's on your engine;  mine is at 106,000 kM's. If you are close to that..spend the $60 Can. and I will help you put it in, Dave||||reg||1
