Z||000003||1FST2M6||03-30-2000||12:24 AM||||Napa part # OS101    if you don't want to pay the inflated price for a GM unit. the wave on the two units are the same and the NAPA-GPC ones cheaper. I've used them both and tested them both on a Snap-On Counsler II and they perform the same. ||||reg||1
