Z||000005||Ed||03-30-2000||12:32 AM||||Sounds more like the air and fuel side. That kind of hesitation could be due to air filter, fuel filter, fuel pressure, and plugged exhaust/catalyst.  ||||reg||1
Z||000006||David Johnson||03-31-2000||10:20 AM||||Sounds a little like what my 87gt acted when the catalytic convertor got plugged up but the o2 sensor is a good bet too<BR>David||||reg||6
Z||000007||88formula||03-31-2000||07:16 PM||||Check the TPS with a good OHMmeter, It is probably bad. You may have a break in the TPS sensor giving you that dead spot with your throttle pedal.||||reg||1
