Z||000009||theogre||03-31-2000||10:27 PM||||Throttle Position Sensor. it's on the end of the throttle shaft on the engine. Don't waste your time testing it. if it even looks bad replace it.<P>check for vac leaks.<P>check static timing.<P>I use Bosch O2 sensors. They never cause me trouble. You can get them lots of places.<BR>||||reg||1
